-- title:
--   Computing exact shared-source control dimensions
-- statement:
--   For block dimensions $h,J$, cutoff $c\le464hJ$, three-cell destination $o$, and scratch after $o+3$, assume the full source-control placement and finite space, word, and depth envelopes. The procedure writes the exact occurrence count, compact capacity, and source-bank span, returns that span, and preserves memory below $o$, within its stated time.
--
--   This control theorem computes the source-bank dimensions and stride instead of accepting those sizes as external inputs.
